- Team ID
    GetGut@AAU

- Task ID
    6.2.2

- Run ID
    1

- Type of training applied
    Concept-level Relation Extraction (C-RE) using SapBERT-based entity linking applied to mention-level relations. Converts mention-level relations to concept-level relations by linking subject and object entity text spans to canonical concept URIs using contextual dictionary matching as described in the scripts of this repository.

- Pre-processing methods
    Sentence-level context extraction using NLTK punkt tokeniser. For each relation's subject and object spans, context format: [entity_span] [SEP] [host_sentence]. Hybrid similarity computation across a pre-encoded contextual dictionary. Entity URI prediction using a weighted combination of span-level and contextual representations.

- Training data used
   Gold, silver, silver2025

- Relevant details of the run
    - Base Model: SapBERT (cambridgeltl/SapBERT-from-PubMedBERT-fulltext)
   
- A link to a GitHub repository enabling easy reproducibility of the run:
   https://github.com/SophusJ/GetGut-AAU
